# macOS
.DS_Store

## User settings
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate

## Derived data / caches (e.g. default Xcode build location)
DerivedData/

## Obj-C/Swift specific
*.hmap

.build/

## Xcode build output (e.g. `xcodebuild ... -derivedDataPath ./build` writes here).
## Compiled artifacts must never be committed.
build/

## Claude Code agent worktrees — tooling scratch, never part of the tree.
.claude/worktrees/

## Full reports written by scripts/docs-check.sh and scripts/docs-sweep.sh — unfiltered,
## regenerated on every run, each script owns its own file.
.docs-check.log
.docs-sweep.log
smoke-logs/
logs/
Sources/AcuShared/Generated/
spikes/input/keyprobe
